  title: Controls
  body: 'WASD: Move   Mouse wheel: Zoom

    Left-click corpse: Raise Dead

    Left-click
    slot / tower: Build menu

    Left-click minion: Command menu (Move = click a
    spot)

    Q: Mass Raise (all corpses around you)

    Right-click: Teleport  
    E: Arcane Nova

    Tab: Minion Bag   1-5: pick minion, then click to place

    Esc:
    Pause / cancel'
